Package: apodemus-sdm
Title: Species Distribution Modeling of Apodemus peninsulae under Climate Change
Version: 1.0.0
Author: 刘一静
Maintainer: liuyijing@email.com
Description: 
    Code and data for undergraduate thesis on predicting habitat
    suitability shifts of Apodemus peninsulae (大林姬鼠) in China
    under future climate scenarios (SSP126, SSP245, SSP585).
    Implements MaxEnt (via maxnet) and Poisson Point Process (PPP)
    models with soil_type interaction, nested cross-validation, and
    Multivariate Environmental Similarity Surface (MOP) analysis.
License: MIT
Depends:
    R >= 4.2.0,
    terra,
    maxnet,
    mgcv,
    pROC,
    ggplot2,
    dplyr,
    corrplot
